{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>One who covers</b> — one who seeks to love his fellow should cover the transgression he committed against him and not make it known to him." "<b>And repeats the matter</b> — to transgress again." "<b>Separates a close friend</b> — that he will love him more than him."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 17, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:23:18.011609693Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}